<p>Increases weapon damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66%</acronym> and physical power by 30 when using bows or slings, as well as your reload rate by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 1, 2, 2.</acronym></p><p>In addition, your Shoot has a 15% chance to mark targets on hit.</p><p>The mark lasts for 5 turns, grants you visibility of the target (even through walls and other concealment), and causes them to become vulnerable to Headshot, Volley and Called Shots.</p>